00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It´s great.
-It´s awesome!

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.491 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.792 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:29.796
